"core": "desmume",
"note": "White (US/EU): as Black (its position sits 0x20 further on) \u2013 gift box (Tepig) \u2192 both rival battles in the room \u2192 Nuvema Town \u2192 Juniper's lab \u2192 Route 1, where a check every few steps watches Juniper's catching demo (her Minccino against a Patrat: the game flags it like a battle, so it shows while it runs and must be gone once it ends \u2013 the checks after it expect no battle) \u2192 a real wild catch (Pok\u00e9 Balls given into the bag). The probe records the battle flag, whose PID battleActive holds, held items, status conditions, badges and the level cap.",
"pos": "[(b=>b[0]|b[1]<<8)(read(0x022592d2,2)), (b=>b[0]|b[1]<<8)(read(0x0224f932,2)), (b=>b[0]|b[1]<<8)(read(0x0224f93a,2))]",
"probe": "(()=>{const u=(a)=>{const b=read(a,2);return b?(b[0]|b[1]<<8).toString(16):null};const r=ctx.parse.readLiveParty(ctx.entry,read,ctx.T,ctx.state);const party=r?.party||[];const b0=read(0x022A7E34,4);const pid=b0?(b0[0]|b0[1]<<8|b0[2]<<16|b0[3]<<24)>>>0:0;let cap=null;try{const {R,doc,manifest}=ctx.run;doc.set('live:p1',{badges:r?.badges,at:Date.now()});cap=R.levelCap(doc,{...manifest,game:{...manifest.game,id:'pokemon-white'}},'p1').cap}catch(e){cap=String(e)}return {flag:u(0x021D07B8),atBattleActive:party.findIndex(m=>m.pid===pid),items:party.map(m=>m.item),status:party.map(m=>m.status),badges:r?.badges,cap}})()",
